          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " blanket is 90 x 100 cm. Every treble is worked into the back loop only, leaving the front loop as a raised horizontal ridge on the right side. Each row adds one ridge, building a corduroy-like stripe across the full width."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aran weight gives prominent ridges that are easy to see and feel. The BLO treble draws in slightly less than BLO dc in the same yarn. Total yardage is around 700 g."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
